          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The BLG model is a 3-dimensional
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SCFT"} SCFT
            involving a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Simons+theory"} Chern-Simons theory
            coupled to matter. It is argued to be the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
            theory of 2 coincident
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-branes"} M2-branes
            with 16 manifest
            = succeed "." do
